<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Uniphase Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Uniphase Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Kevin Slocum initiated coverage of Uniphase Corp as short-term buy, long-term hold.</p>
<p>-- set earnings estimates of $0.90 a share for fiscal 1997 and $1.40 a share for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- Uniphase gained 1/2 to 46.</p>
</text>
